":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","review_id":"vd7dimsZDItTnctX10Ec-A","date":"2018-07-27T16:43:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9430513381958008,"text_excerpt":"One of the better food trucks in New Orleans is La Cocinita. If you're looking for authentic street tacos, this is one of the places to go. I got the tacos with pulled pork and chipotle. The taco shells and sauce were to perfection. The pork was also delicious, but it was just a little on the dry side. Overall this is still a very delicious food truck, and I would recommend it. The staff was also super friendly, and the service was quick."},{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","review_id":"e6a8RdrspjhrIgbODlqOWw","date":"2016-08-28T22:02:16","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9362618327140808,"text_excerpt":"Chalk one up to my neighbor Tabby A. for throwing a really cool party yesterday. She had quite a nice spread of food on hand and a bartender serving free drinks throughout the evening. But the real culinary treat was the food truck. And I'm not talking just any old food truck; but rather, La Cocinita. If you are not sight impaired, or driving around in some sort of stupor, chances are that you've seen this bright red food truck in the city. Owner Rachel Billow has got a real winner with this food truck and her catering business. La Cocinita, translated literally as \"the Little Kitchen,\" serves up fresh gourmet styled street food from Latin America. As this was a catered party, the food tr..."},{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","review_id":"XHkesga9HNi9GtWQMi7BiQ","date":"2014-04-30T18:32:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.933725118637085,"text_excerpt":"La Cocinita offers Latin inspired food that is fresh, and darn good. Sometimes when I look back at my older reviews I get pretty embarrassed. Since my last review was a bit of a half-assed effort where I couldn't even remember the names of food, I've decided to update it. The proliferation of food trucks in New Orleans is a trend that I fully support. They offer a great, quick alternative to brick and mortar restaurants and I couldn't be happier about them. Now that I've got that out of the way, I will explain why this truck is one of my favorites. Since my first visit, I have visited La Cocinita several times. My most recent visit was today, and a direct result of Angie T.'s recent revie..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","photo_id":"zJRgjBDrozo9r8UE1_655Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/zJRgjBDrozo9r8UE1_655Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.86521977186203},{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","photo_id":"mjQ5jOi2AxCkiJSXx9wl-Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/mjQ5jOi2AxCkiJSXx9wl-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8555784225463867},{"business_id":"ETIyqDHJtwX3YUChlLAYtg","photo_id":"Ivvxm89uvUCgxtX4kFVSMg","label":"outside"